=== layout: two-panels

# Milestones and Competition Form

@left

## Company and product

- What is your company's name?
- What does the logo mean?
- What is the first marketable product?
- What problem does the product solve?
- Use short answers; the form link is in Blackboard.

@right

## Competition and milestones

- How will your company do better than competitors?
- What will you achieve by year 1?
- What will you achieve by year 3?
- What will you achieve by year 5?

